<title>NETHERLANDS: Rodamco '97/98 Q1 net profit up 28 pct.</title>
<headline>Rodamco '97/98 Q1 net profit up 28 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First qtr to May 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   143    vs 112</p>
<p>    Shr (guilders)			 0.90 vs   0.71</p>
<p>    Property revaluation gain	 14    vs  21</p>
<p>    Currency loss			 46    vs 173 gain</p>
<p>    Other gains			    4    vs   4 charge</p>
<p>Net asset value/shr (guilders)  56.19 vs  55.47</p>
<p>NOTE - Property investment fund Rodamco NV previously said it expected higher profits in the financial year 1997/98. NAV comparison as of February 28, 1997.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
